WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.150
Sayaka, the greatest 
vessel I have ever found.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.150
This is the result of the monumental 
research Yukari-sama ordered Renpu...

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.890
No, me to carry out.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:23.660
Once you are granted this power, 
you will be complete as a vessel.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.980
You will think nothing and feel nothing.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.990
You will simply be a Toji who strikes 
those who wrong Yukari-sama.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.650
Nothing...

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:47.680
Sayaka, what are you doing?

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.070
I'm...

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:12.500
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:30.370
<b>Episode 7  Heart Ache</b>

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.590
We're low on bandages,
so stop playing around!

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:38.670
Hey, put this aradama outside right now!

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.950
Like I told you, Nene is my pet,

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:43.840
Ow, ow, ow! Just because we're low 
on bandages doesn't mean you have

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:43.840
you eternally flat-chested woman.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.010
to wrap it so tight, Hiyori-chan!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.060
Eternally?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.010
Please don't blame Nene, Hiyoyon.

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:55.680
It's my fault we don't have
 enough bandages, since I used so much.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.290
Anyway, what a shock that was.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:07.200
I can't believe FineMan 
is Ellen's grandfather!

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.440
That's true.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.210
What a huge taxi.

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:18.380
It is an honor to meet you two rebels.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.710
Today is certainly a perfect day.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.560
Could it be...

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.510
Are you FineMan?

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:32.260
FineMan is an alias I use to conceal myself
 from the world, but my true identity is...

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.890
Richard Friedman!

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:37.730
Creator of the S Equipment, and my grandpa.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.540
Oh, no!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:44.140
You spoiled it, my beloved granddaughter.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:53.310
So your grandfather made this, Ellen-chan?

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.070
Not just me.

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:58.120
I also had help from many other engineers.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:03.410
More importantly, why is a foreign 
engineer working with Mokusa?

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:07.880
Because I've watched the Origami 
family more closely than anyone.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.970
Shortly after the Pacific War, collaborative
development of the S Equipment by the US Army

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:18.290
and the Origami family began as part of 
a plan to divert noro for military use.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.600
However, when development 
stagnated without progress,

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:27.610
and the technology came to a 
dead end, we had a breakthrough.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.360
That was about 20 years ago.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.790
Twenty years...

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.870
The Great Disaster of Sagami Bay.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.720
After the Great Disaster, when she
 became head of the family,

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:43.570
Origami Yukari purged the traditional 
forces and started to streamline things.

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.900
Streamline?

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:49.330
As you know, noro was once 
divided up into smaller pieces

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.340
and enshrined in various parts of the country.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:55.470
The Origami family gathered up all the noro

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:58.350
and began to manage them themselves.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:02.980
From then on, the level of the technology 
in development suddenly increased,

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.230
and the S Equipment was completed.

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:11.240
And the one who brought about that 
technology was Origami Yukari.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.820
Origami Yukari did?

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:19.330
But from the perspective of a scientist, 
this was technology that should not exist.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:23.330
Gathering up the noro and the 
technology that it brought about...

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:26.590
I wonder just where it all came from?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.840
Where from?

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.590
It can't be!

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:37.190
Which is why I formed Mokusa in 
cooperation with a certain person

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.560
who was suspicious about 
the Origami family, like me.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.560
A certain person?

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:44.950
Since then, we have been polishing

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:48.320
the blade of our resistance against 
Origami Yukari behind the scenes.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:53.570
Your mother, Juujou Kagari, was part
 of those I sought help from.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:59.920
I am truly glad to meet you,
 the daughter of our savior, like this.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:05.110
Thanks to Hiyoyon's mom,
our preparations gradually finished,

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.590
but we couldn't have predicted that just 
when we were finally about to strike,

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:17.590
that you would charge Origami Yukari
head-on, almost ruining our secret plan.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:22.100
In short, it's your fault that 
everything has gone to crap.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:25.470
I just did what I had to for my objective.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.350
Oh, Hiyori-chan...

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:29.520
But there was a good thing to come of it!

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:33.900
If we give this to Sana-sensei, 
she will analyze it in detail.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:37.570
Which means, if we can prove the Origami 
family is conducting inhumane research

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:40.820
to turn people into artificial aradama,

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:45.650
we could deal a great blow to 
Origami Yukari's regime.

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:48.660
So, our mission is done.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.300
The old man and president are 
going to handle the rest.

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:54.590
What's the matter, Hiyori-chan?

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:59.050
Nothing, I just can't believe the Osafune 
president is a member of Mokusa.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.570
They say boys grow a lot in three days.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.500
But they shouldn't forget about girls, either.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:17.950
I like the look on your face.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.410
I-I guess so?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.040
Have you decided on a plan?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.500
It's probably not as impressive 
compared to my friend,

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.620
but I've decided to do my best.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.090
Why?

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:36.340
I don't want to let her to die.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:39.380
Yeah, yeah, I totally understand 
where you're coming from.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:44.100
I, too, wouldn't mind giving 
half my life for a friend.

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.810
That's not all of it.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:52.340
Anyway, Kanami! Come on, 
let's hurry and do this.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.290
Right.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.190
I'm definitely going to 
get a hit on you today!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.200
<b>Juujou Kagari-sama</b>

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.210
<b>Juujou Kagari-sama</b>

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:21.260
The sky here looks different
 than it does at Minoseki.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.220
I wonder how Kanami-chan is doing.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.890
Who would be calling at this hour?

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.810
Hello?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.100
What's the matter, Sayaka-chan?

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:46.130
Thanks for calling. I'm so 
happy you called me so quickly.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:53.460
Shall we be chatty night owls together?

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:57.070
<i>Thank you for coming.</i>

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.130
It's all right, I'm listening.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.050
<i>Um...</i>

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.100
<i>It's nothing.</i>

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.600
Sayaka-chan?

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.770
What did you just say?

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:22.530
I said that the elite guard cannot 
assist in your search for Itomi Sayaka.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:26.660
Our job is to guard Yukari-sama, anyway.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.010
We have no right or obligation

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.750
to meddle in the interior problems 
of Renpu Girls' Academy.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.350
It is precisely because 
it is for Yukari-sama!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.910
Sayaka is the most suitable person 
to be Yukari-sama's right hand!

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:41.010
She's different from you incompetents, 
who couldn't even capture the traitors!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.890
Elite guard! Bring back Sayaka 
immediately for Yukari-sama's sake!

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:50.390
I am sorry that we cannot measure 
up to your expectations.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:51.790
Damn you, Shidou!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.360
Be quiet.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:58.400
You are the one who is tormenting 
Yukari-sama, President Takatsu.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:09.130
Those useless brats! They're just 
afraid of being replaced by Sayaka.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.200
President Takatsu...

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.000
Yomi?

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:17.250
Unable to control your precious powers,

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:21.510
and yet you call yourself a member of the 
elite guard while in that pathetic state.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:26.870
You're just a prototype that Yukari-sama 
took in out of the kindness of her heart.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.510
Learn your place.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.120
My...

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:36.140
If you want my power, then here.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:39.330
If I want your power?!

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:42.640
The power you have been 
given is nothing more

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:46.410
than overflowing garbage that 
is for completing Sayaka!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.070
But you were summoned by 
Yukari-sama, so you've gotten

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.790
so full of yourself that you 
think you can look down on me?!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.120
Don't forget!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:56.370
As long as Sayaka is around, 
you lot are no longer needed!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.840
Wow, that old lady is pissed.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:08.840
<i>Sayaka-chan is about the same 
age I was when I ran away from home.</i>

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:16.370
Wasn't everyone saying she's
 a genius or something?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.490
I bet everyone would be shocked if I got her.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.200
<b>Yanase Mai
Mobile</b>

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.200
<b>Riot Police Headquarters
Unknown</b>

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.200
<b>Riot Police Headquarters
Missed Call</b>

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.200
<b>Riot Police Headquarters
Unknown</b>

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.200
<b>Riot Police Headquarters
Unknown</b>

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.200
<b>Riot Police Headquarters</b>

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:33.700
Why did I...?

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:38.560
Sayaka?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.040
Sayaka? Wait!

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.450
I've always done as I was told.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:56.240
But I would surely disappear
 if that got into me.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.190
Totally disappear.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:09.870
Wait! Sayaka-chan!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.160
Found you.

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:20.370
I'm sorry I'm so late.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:23.740
I went around to all the 
convenience stores in the area.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.930
Why? I didn't...

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.510
Are you hungry?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.290
Let's get something from
 the convenience store...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:37.030
Oh, but they wouldn't let
 middle schoolers buy anything at night...

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:38.270
Oh, right!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.450
I still have some, thank goodness.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.380
Cookies.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:49.310
I told you about my younger 
sister yesterday, right?

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:50.180
Yeah.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:53.650
She's basically really selfish, 
and it's to the point

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:57.620
where I've asked her if she just 
makes it a hobby to bug me.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:01.360
Because of that, though,
 when she's really in trouble,

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:04.450
she absolutely will not ask me for help.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.000
Strange isn't it?
 Even though it's so obvious.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.510
How do you know?

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.720
I just do, because I'm her big sister.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.280
This is just like that time.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.980
Found you, Sayaka-chan.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.330
You're from the elite guard.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.900
Now, then, let's get back.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.150
Old Lady Takatsu is waiting for you.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:36.410
What's this? Do you not want to go back?

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.300
I see, what a bind.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.790
Hey, what do you think I should do, miss?

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.450
Sayaka-chan?

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.250
If I go back that'll be the end of it.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.260
Are you sure?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:54.110
I don't know what's going on,
 but are you really sure?

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:59.740
Tell me how you feel.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:03.900
H-How I...?

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.040
I don't...

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.640
I don't want to.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:16.740
Okay, then.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:19.080
Well, then, how about we play hide and seek?

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.470
I'll give you till the count of ten.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.950
If you can get away from me,

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:27.710
I'll pretend that I don't know 
or haven't seen anything.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:33.010
One, two, three, four...

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.280
Sayaka-chan!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:38.760
<i>I knew that would work, otherwise I 
wouldn't get to show you how amazing I am.</i>

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.490
Done already?

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.870
There's still more fun to be had!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:05.690
Just kidding.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.260
They're amazing.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:20.390
You're good, Sayaka-chan,
 but that's not all, is it?

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:28.290
Sayaka-chan!

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:33.280
I know you can use some kind 
of amazing technique, right?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.530
Wasn't it being free from all emotions?

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:41.030
You won't be able to cut anything 
with a soulless sword like that!

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.290
What? You're not gonna do it?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.310
It's a little unsatisfying,

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:52.380
but I've already wasted 
my time, so let's end this!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:55.840
Oopsie.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:05.640
What a surprise. You're pretty
good yourself, miss.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.140
Only just a bit, though.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.060
Let's keep going!

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:18.860
Ooh, you're pretty stubborn!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.920
N-No, stop...

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.990
I'm fine. It's okay.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.790
Why?

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:27.330
Because.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:31.330
I'm older than you, Sayaka-chan.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.880
That's reason enough for me.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:38.800
<i>It hurts. It hurts so much,</i>

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:45.250
<i>but it's so warm and hot that 
it's filling my emptiness.</i>

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.450
<i>I don't want...</i>

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.860
Are you finished already?

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:57.790
Then it's time for a break!

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:00.030
Sayaka-chan?

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.780
I don't want to lose this!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:11.870
No way!

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:19.990
Sayaka-chan!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.600
I'm fine.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.850
You're great! So great, Sayaka-chan!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:40.610
Sayaka-chan!

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:43.110
I was just starting to get serious,

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.520
but you're not what I thought you were.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:48.120
What are you doing, Yume?

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.410
Renpu's President Takatsu...

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:58.250
Stand down! This isn't the business of 
a defective product, such as yourself.

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.350
Okay, okay, I got it.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:21.410
Yume! Damn you, what have you done?!

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:24.730
What a waste of my time.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.570
Thanks.

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:31.370
Sure.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.250
Sayaka! Enough of your selfishness.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.500
Now, come back to Renpu.

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:39.870
Sayaka-chan...

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.050
Right.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.340
That's right, Sayaka.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:47.830
You're different from those defective 
models in the elite guard.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:48.950
You'll be a perfect Toji—

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:52.250
I can't be the Toji you want me to be.

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:56.230
No, I don't want to be.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:19:00.020
Eh? What are you saying?

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:02.790
I thought I was fine being empty,

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:08.090
but I don't want to lose the 
warmth that has filled me.

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:11.670
That's why I want to fight,

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:15.460
and be with the people who 
gave me this warm feeling.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.510
What?

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.990
You are the successor of Myouhou Muramasa,

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:24.260
and you're supposed to serve Yukari-sama 
in my place! No, as I serve her!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.800
You are a tool only for Yukari-sama!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:36.610
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.500
Wait...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.740
W-Wait, Sayaka!

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:49.950
Sayaka!

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:04.110
Let's do a bunch of things...
No, all the things you want to do.

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:06.990
Kanami-chan and I are both with you, okay?

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.490
I want to eat.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:10.970
What?

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.470
I want to eat your cookies again.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.390
Okay, with pleasure!

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:21.740
Lady Mai,

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.660
I have come to get you.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.110
Shibata-san, why are you here?

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:31.870
Because I asked him to.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:35.370
President Hashima... U-Um, I...

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.220
I have a rough grasp of the situation.

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.260
You two need to get away from here for now.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:48.480
I wonder whose fault it is 
that I'm so good at

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:50.250
cleaning up after reckless girls.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.390
Hello, Sana?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.290
Yes, you just need to hide them.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:58.890
What they do from there is up to them.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.390
Oh, me?

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:05.250
I've... Yes, I've accepted my fate.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.880
Mai-chan!

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.120
Kanami-chan!

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:24.580
Let's see, Mai-chan, um, um...

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.620
Anyway, there's lots I want to tell you!

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:30.190
Yes, yes. I have lots to tell you, too.

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.180
Sayaka-chan!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:35.640
It's just like they said! 
You really did come!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:39.430
Welcome! Mokusa warmly welcomes you both!

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:46.060
Have some restraint, you pervert.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.730
Juujou-san...

00:21:57.390 --> 00:21:59.330
Welcome to Mokusa.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:03.660
Young Toji, my name is Origami Akane.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Next Episode  Day of Disaster</b>
